  "details": "There are several very handy constraints in the Animation Rigging package that VRC currently does not have an equivalent for.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.animation.rigging@1.2/manual/ConstraintComponents.html\n\nIn particular, the two twist constraints (twist correction and twist chain) are big time-savers for onerous constraint tasks, and damped transform allows for more controllable secondary movement without needing to use physbones.",
